{"parse": {"title": "主线故事", "pageid": 160, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"headnote-box\"><div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n<div style=\"margin-right:1.5em;\"><img alt=\"Disambig orange.svg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Disambig_orange.svg/25px-Disambig_orange.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" class=\"no-select\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Disambig_orange.svg/38px-Disambig_orange.svg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Disambig_orange.svg/50px-Disambig_orange.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"220\" data-file-height=\"168\" /></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1; min-width:0; font-weight:600; line-height:1.2em\" class=\"serif\">本页面是各主线系列的目录<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\">&#91;1&#93;</a></sup>。要查看具体的关卡，参见：<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AB%A0%E8%8A%82%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8/%E4%B8%BB%E7%BA%BF%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B\" title=\"章节列表/主线故事\">章节列表/主线故事</a>；要查看主线故事中的<abbr title=\"游戏过场图片\">CG</abbr>图片，参见：<a href=\"/wiki/CG/%E4%B8%BB%E7%BA%BF%E5%89%A7%E6%83%85\" title=\"CG/主线剧情\">CG/主线剧情</a>；要查看主线故事的活动页面，请搜索主线故事的同名页面。</div>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span id=\"1.0_.E7.94.9F.E8.80.85.E4.B8.8E.E4.BD.99.E4.BC.97\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1.0_生者与余众\">1.0 <big><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>生者与余众</b></span></big></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Pic_section_1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Pic section 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Pic_section_1.png/210px-Pic_section_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"210\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Pic_section_1.png/316px-Pic_section_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Pic_section_1.png/421px-Pic_section_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"424\" data-file-height=\"604\" /></a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"storylines\">\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">序幕</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">此即明日</div><div class=\"storyline-number\"><sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\">&#91;2&#93;</a></sup></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1966 · The Storm is coming.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\"><img alt=\"序章海报示意图.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ea/%E5%BA%8F%E7%AB%A0%E6%B5%B7%E6%8A%A5%E7%A4%BA%E6%84%8F%E5%9B%BE.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"287\" height=\"500\" data-file-width=\"287\" data-file-height=\"500\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第一章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9C%A8%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E9%87%8C\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"在我们的时代里\">在我们的时代里</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1929 · Leave the rest to me.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Pic_101.png/290px-Pic_101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"290\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3f/Pic_101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"369\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第二章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%9C%E8%89%B2%E6%B8%A9%E6%9F%94\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"夜色温柔\">夜色温柔</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1929 · Don't forget me.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/Pic_102.png/290px-Pic_102.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"290\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/58/Pic_102.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"369\" data-file-height=\"635\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第三章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A0%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"故事一无所有\">故事一无所有</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\"><sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\">&#91;3&#93;</a></sup>1913 · Have a nice dream.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 103.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/Pic_103.png/290px-Pic_103.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"290\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/ce/Pic_103.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"369\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第四章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%80%81%E8%99%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%87%91%E9%BB%84\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"老虎的金黄\">老虎的金黄</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1913 · Happy birthday to you.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Pic_104.png/291px-Pic_104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"291\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2b/Pic_104.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"370\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第五章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9E%E7%A9%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9A%E5%BE%92\" title=\"洞穴的囚徒\">洞穴的囚徒</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1913 ~ 1914 (2007) · Who led us to the exile in this cave.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Pic_105.png/295px-Pic_105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"295\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pic_105.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"376\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n     <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第六章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%8A%E5%A4%9C%E6%98%9F%E5%85%89%E7%81%BF%E7%83%82\" title=\"今夜星光灿烂\">今夜星光灿烂</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1913 · We still have a show to enjoy.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/Pic_106.png/295px-Pic_106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"295\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/86/Pic_106.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"376\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第七章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%A4%E7%8B%AC%E4%B9%8B%E6%AD%8C\" title=\"孤独之歌\">孤独之歌</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\"><sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\">&#91;4&#93;</a></sup>1914、1990 · We are all lonely.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 107.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Pic_107.png/295px-Pic_107.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"295\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/35/Pic_107.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"376\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\"2.0_.E6.97.85.E8.A1.8C.E5.BD.92.E6.9D.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2.0_旅行归来\">2.0 <big><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>旅行归来</b></span></big></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Pic_section_2.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Pic section 2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Pic_section_2.png/210px-Pic_section_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"210\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Pic_section_2.png/316px-Pic_section_2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Pic_section_2.png/421px-Pic_section_2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"424\" data-file-height=\"604\" /></a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"storylines\">\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第八章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BF%A7%E9%83%81%E7%9A%84%E7%83%AD%E5%B8%A6\" title=\"忧郁的热带\">忧郁的热带</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1990 · The Die Is Cast.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 108.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/Pic_108.png/295px-Pic_108.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"295\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/80/Pic_108.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"376\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第九章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%96%AF%E7%99%AB%E4%B8%8E%E6%96%87%E6%98%8E\" title=\"疯癫与文明\">疯癫与文明</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1991 · Our Mind Is a Prison.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 109.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/Pic_109.png/295px-Pic_109.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"295\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7a/Pic_109.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"376\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第十章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%90%E5%9B%AD\" title=\"复乐园\">复乐园</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1991 · Paradise Regained</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Pic_110.png/295px-Pic_110.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"295\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3d/Pic_110.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"376\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\"3.0_.E6.95.85.E4.BA.8B.E7.9A.84.E6.A0.B9.E9.A1.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"3.0_故事的根须\">3.0 <big><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>故事的根须</b></span></big></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Pic_section_3.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Pic section 3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Pic_section_3.png/210px-Pic_section_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"210\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Pic_section_3.png/316px-Pic_section_3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Pic_section_3.png/421px-Pic_section_3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"424\" data-file-height=\"604\" /></a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"storylines\">\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第十一章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%8E%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E9%95%BF%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%8A\" title=\"行于漫漫长路上\">行于漫漫长路上</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1920 · A Long Long Way</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/Pic_111.png/292px-Pic_111.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"292\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/65/Pic_111.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"371\" data-file-height=\"635\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第十二章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BF%9C%E5%BE%81%E8%AE%B0\" title=\"远征记\">远征记</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1920 · Слово о полку</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Pic_112.png/295px-Pic_112.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"295\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b4/Pic_112.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"376\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第十三章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80\" title=\"他者的悲哀\">他者的悲哀</a></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1921 · On Another's Sorrow</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\"><img alt=\"Pic 113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Pic_113.png/295px-Pic_113.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"295\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e4/Pic_113.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"376\" data-file-height=\"636\" /></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">在这个页面，每章的格言旁边为该章发生的历史时间点，但如果出现了 特殊的时间点 （一般是现实的符合正常时间流向的时间点），则会在 历史时间点 后面注明这一特殊时间点。</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">序幕旁的海报是将官方“上映前倒计时”的海报作为底图，售卖的主线海报周边作为排版依据，由本维基复刻的，因此非官方提供的图片，仅供参考。</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">根据第四章可知现实时间线是1913年，但回忆的时间点未知</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">7TH-1 对角线中~7TH-27 酒神颂为1914年，7TH-28 数轴的两端~7TH-30 谢幕词为1990年。</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "包含顶注的页面", "hidden": true}], "displaytitle": "主线故事"}}